# React Native + Expo — project rules

Source of truth: `CLAUDE.md` and `.claude/rules/*.md`. Summary:

## Stack
Expo (dev build) · TS strict · Expo Router · TanStack Query v5 · Zustand · axios · RHF + Zod ·
Unistyles 3 · i18next (en/es) · secure-store + MMKV · FlashList · expo-image · Jest/RNTL/MSW · Maestro.

## Structure
- `app/` routes only: `export { XScreen as default } from '@/features/x';`
- `src/core`, `src/ui` (design system, imports nothing), `src/features/<x>/{data,domain,queries,forms,ui,i18n,di.ts,index.ts}`.
- Other features only via their `index.ts`.

## Data
- axios `api`/`publicApi`; every error → `ApiError` with `kind`. 401 signs out only if `message === 'Unauthorized'`.
- DTO = `Pick<>` of generated types; mapper per endpoint drops unused fields and PII.
- TanStack for all server data; key factories; `queryOptions`; retry only GET 502/503/504; mutations never retried; invalidate by prefix; never persist cache.
- Zustand only session + current assignment; derive profile/tabs/scope.

## Code style
- Named exports (except route files). `PascalCase.tsx` components, `camelCase.ts` modules, `useX` hooks.
- Alphabetical: JSX props (key/ref first, on* last), object keys, type members, unions, named imports.
- Imports grouped: react/react-native → expo → third-party → `@/` → relative → `import type`.
- No `console.*` (logger), no `any`, no hex/magic numbers (tokens), no hardcoded text (i18n en+es).
- Files ≤250 lines target, 450 max.
- Never edit `ios/`, `android/`, `generated/`. Add deps with `npx expo install`.

## Tests
Next to code. Unit for pure code; RNTL + MSW for hooks/screens; no mocks of own modules.
